.PP
.nf
Checks if sys\&.real_prefix is set\&.

This handles virtual environments created with pypa's virtualenv\&.

.fi
.PP
 
.SS " bool pip\&._internal\&.utils\&.virtualenv\&._running_under_venv ()\fC [protected]\fP"

.PP
.nf
